   "success": true,
   "answer": "Five things need attention today: a door shortage for this week's installs, two overdue balances, a quiet $52,400 estimate and two jobs that are not moving.\n\n::: priorities\nhigh | Order Clopay Classic Steel 16x7 White doors ([Inventory](page:inventory)) | Jobs booked in the next 7 days need 5 and only 2 are on hand, short 3; the first visit is today. | Order 3 today, or move one of this week's installs.\nhigh | Collect $9,860 from [Northgate Property Group](customer:Northgate Property Group) | The biggest of 3 invoices over 60 days ($17,090 in all): 96 days old, on a 90 Day Notice ([1095802214](job:1095802214)). | Call their accounts payable; the 90-day letter task is still open.\nmedium | Follow up on [1095809931](estimate:1095809931) for [Riverside Logistics](customer:Riverside Logistics) | $52,400 with no status change for 22 days, the larger of 2 quiet estimates worth $71,150. | Ask Morgan Hayes to call this week.\nmedium | Get [1095810231](job:1095810231) for Ozark Ridge Homes moving | In Need To Order for 41 days ($8,450) with no visit booked; the Oct 14 note says Clopay needs two more weeks. | Ask Clopay for a delivery date.\nlow | Book [1095810877](job:1095810877) for Hartwell Builders | Need To Schedule for 29 days, with an open task to pick an install date. | Call Hartwell Builders to set a date.\n:::\n\nSince Monday: $8,555 collected, 5 status changes, and money owed is down $2,625 to $43,371.\n\n::: basis\nMoney owed: invoiced jobs (Final Invoice Sent or Check on Payment) as of today; days counted from the job end date.\nStuck: active jobs 14+ days in one status. Quiet estimates: open, dated in the last 120 days, $1,000+, no change for 14+ days.\n:::\n\n::: followups\nWhich other jobs are stuck?\nShow every balance over 60 days\nWhat changed since Monday?\n:::",
